{"id": "29d507d47a4c", "phenomenon": "final_particle", "pattern": "也", "text": "君在，踧踖如也，與與如也。", "span": [6, 7], "matched": "也", "context": {"clause_final": true, "sentence_initial": false}, "provenance": {"dataset_id": "zh-wikisource", "work_id": "zhws-lunyu", "line": 386, "sentence_offset": 23, "page_title": "論語/鄉黨第十", "oldid": "11118092", "source_sha256": "478f2e3f7400bb652ba211d539a52210e2881e64d4e625bf7b5381aa54ab710f", "data_license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0 and GFDL (Chinese Wikisource contributions)"}, "corpus_split": "validation", "status": "candidate", "annotation": null, "draft_annotation": {"function": "final_particle", "is_target_use": true, "proposed_expectation": "no_expectation", "rationale": "「踧踖如也」は「如」+「也」の形容語尾。文末の「也」だが判断の「也」と同列に扱えるか割れるため、期待を置かない。", "ambiguity": "high", "drafted_by": "claude-draft (unreviewed; no grammar reference checked)", "needs": "human review; reference required before any separable/unit expectation"}}
{"id": "740bfbd56cc6", "phenomenon": "final_particle", "pattern": "也", "text": "世之為丘壟也，其高大若山，其樹之若林，其設闕庭、為宮室、造賓阼也若都邑，以此觀世示富則可矣，以此為死則不可也。", "span": [31, 32], "matched": "也", "context": {"clause_final": false, "sentence_initial": false}, "provenance": {"dataset_id": "zh-wikisource", "work_id": "zhws-lushichunqiu", "line": 362, "sentence_offset": 0, "page_title": "呂氏春秋/卷十", "oldid": "2327718", "source_sha256": "d61d697dbe1683288b4c087281db591dbf49196bc438b21bda54b06243f717c7", "data_license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0 and GFDL (Chinese Wikisource contributions)"}, "corpus_split": "test", "status": "candidate", "annotation": null, "draft_annotation": {"function": "non_final_use", "is_target_use": false, "proposed_expectation": "no_expectation", "rationale": "「造賓阼也、若都邑」のように文中で停頓・提示を示す「也」。文末助辞ではない反例候補。", "ambiguity": "medium", "drafted_by": "claude-draft (unreviewed; no grammar reference checked)", "needs": "human review; reference required before any separable/unit expectation"}}
